]},{"date":"2016-04-12T08:57:10-07:00","id":864325,"title":"","content":"I get the impression that in this city the seelie and unseelie are heavily divided with unseelies not allowed in seelie controlled territory (although the divide may be purely political - individuals seem like they can still get along. The corgi pooka and Violet clearly know each other). It seems like it was a minor enough infraction that it would have been settled by the pooka knight escorting her out, but humans going missing at her concert upped the scrutiny the seelie court is giving the incident.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-12T13:14:40-07:00","id":864479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/861789-new-changeling-webcomic?p=864325#post864325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I get the impression that in this city the seelie and unseelie are heavily divided with unseelies not allowed in seelie controlled territory (although the divide may be purely political - individuals seem like they can still get along. The corgi pooka and Violet clearly know each other). It seems like it was a minor enough infraction that it would have been settled by the pooka knight escorting her out, but humans going missing at her concert upped the scrutiny the seelie court is giving the incident.</div> </div> </div> </div>That wasn't at all clear to me. Thanks for clarifying!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T06:37:46-07:00","id":864887,"title":"","content":"Of course, none of that is outright stated. It's just my interpretation from the what the characters have said and how they interact with each other. We, as readers, have been dropped into the middle of things. I'm sure things will get explained more as the comic continues.<br /> <br /> I love the artwork though! The use of color is fantastic - the grey tones in most of the world and the splashes of vibrancy on things of glamour!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 04-13-2016, 09:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-27T10:56:49-07:00","id":875762,"title":"","content":"Love it! As it was said, the b&amp;w/color mixing is a real catcher and the overall style is loveable! It's too early to say anything about the deeper story, but the characters are very evocative and interesting. I absolutely love that the most bossy 'enforcer' type character so far is an ordinary human! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-27T13:37:18-07:00","id":875928,"title":"","content":"Definitely a good find. Thanks.<br /> <br /> Though I am curious why only the &quot;good guys&quot; seem to get color. The creepy perv sidhe that rifled through the MC's underwear drawer was colorless, as was the redcap from the start, but the aide has colored eyes, so maybe she's going to help the MC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11658,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11658-rabbit-pooka","user":"Rabbit Pooka","date":". 04-27-2016, 05:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11658-rabbit-pooka"